Andee Mini
This is a modified version of Andee (https://github.com/kuafuai/andee), v0.12.1,
by kuafuai, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes in this copy (2026-11-08):
- Double-tap on the floating ball opens a small chat popup (MiniChatActivity)
  instead of the full card. The popup hides itself while Andee reads or taps the
  screen and comes back when the answer arrives.
- A GitHub Actions workflow (mini-apk.yml) builds an arm64 APK signed with a fixed key.
